SUMMARY:Apollo v4.0.0
DESCRIPTION:Apollo 4.0.0 | Apollo-Reborn-4.0.0\n\n### Features\n\n- Add **i
 Phone Duo** support with layouts that adapt to the closed display\, open p
 ortrait\, open landscape and partially folded positions\, using the existi
 ng Apollo Reborn builds (#1245: @IllIIllIllIllII)\n  - Browse a feed besid
 e its comments\, choose Original or Focused content widths\, and open the 
 subreddit list in a Standard or Liquid Glass panel\n  - Inbox\, Account an
 d Settings gain sidebar/detail layouts in open landscape\, while Search ca
 n keep results beside the page you open\n  - Pixel Pals is unavailable on 
 Duo\; regular iPhones keep it\n- Add an optional **iPad Layout (Beta)** on
  iPadOS 18 and later\, with a native sidebar\, adjustable feed and reader 
 columns\, and full-width Gallery View (#1385: @jordanearle)\n  - Try it fr
 om the one-time invitation or turn on iPad Layout under Interface\; quit a
 nd reopen Apollo to apply it\, or turn it off to return to the classic lay
 out\n- Add **Restore Reading Session** to reopen your last feed\, post and
  nearby reading position after iOS closes Apollo\, including feed and comm
 ent sorting (#1441: @Thetromboneman1)\n  - On by default under Media → B
 rowsing\; explicit links and notifications take priority\, and turning it 
 off deletes the saved session\n- Add a **Setup Assistant** for new install
 ations to connect or restore\, choose Classic\, Balanced or Full Featured 
 preferences\, select appearance\, and review before applying (#1401: @jord
 anearle)\n  - Existing users can open it from Apollo Reborn settings with 
 Keep My Settings selected\; updating does not automatically apply a preset
 \n- Rework **Gallery View** with faster opening\, pinch-to-resize tiles in
 cluding a denser four-column layout\, and native press-and-hold menus in t
 he grid and fullscreen viewer (#1389\, #1434: @icpryde\, @IllIIllIllIllII)
 \n  - Sports clips can play silently in the grid\, newly visible tiles sta
 rt reliably\, and returning from a fullscreen image no longer leaves a bla
 ck screen\n- Open **Gallery View** for All Saved or a selec
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/apollo.json
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:apollo-3.9.0@omnisource
DTSTAMP:20261009T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261009
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261010
SUMMARY:Apollo v3.9.0
DESCRIPTION:Apollo 3.9.0 | Apollo-Reborn-3.9.0\n\n### Features\n\n- Add an 
 **in-app update prompt**: from the next release on\, Apollo Reborn checks 
 for updates once a day and\, when one is out\, lets you send it to AltStor
 e\, SideStore\, Feather\, or FlareStore or download the IPA\, with the rel
 ease notes a tap away (#1343: @IllIIllIllIllII)\n  - Tap **Later** or **Sk
 ip this version** to put it off\, check any time with **Check for Updates*
 * (About)\, or turn off **Automatic Update Checks** (Privacy\, on by defau
 lt)\; jailbreak installs don't check\n  - What's New now shows the app ico
 n you picked instead of the default one\n- Open the **subreddit switcher**
  as a native sheet when you tap a feed's title\, with search\, your favori
 tes\, and live results\, instead of the small floating dropdown\; typing a
  multireddit like apple+iphone still works (#1313\, #1387: @IllIIllIllIllI
 I)\n  - Press and hold the **Posts** tab to open it while a feed is open\,
  now on Liquid Glass too\, and the search field stays in place as you scro
 ll the sheet\n- Add a **Liquid Glass** switch (Interface → Appearance\, 
 on by default) so Liquid Glass builds can use Apollo's classic look withou
 t installing a different IPA\; quit and reopen Apollo for the change to ap
 ply (#1384: @IllIIllIllIllII)\n  - Shown on Liquid Glass builds on iOS 26 
 and later\, except inside LiveContainer\; while it's off\, Liquid Glass-on
 ly options are hidden\n- Add a **Minimize** Hide Style for **Hide Bars on 
 Scroll** (Interface → Tab Bar\, Liquid Glass) that shrinks the tab bar i
 nto a small glass pill showing the current tab as you scroll\, like Safari
 \; tap the pill or scroll back up to bring the full bar back (#1349\, #138
 4: @IllIIllIllIllII)\n  - With any Hide Style on Liquid Glass\, a tab bar 
 or header hidden by scrolling now slides back in when you open a page or g
 o back or forward\, and the tab bar no longer comes back on its own after 
 30 seconds\n- Add **Reduce Rate Limiting** (Accounts & API Keys → Experi
 mental\, off by default) so **API-Key-Free** accounts hit Reddi
URL:https://raynmahbub.github.io/OmniSource/feeds/apollo.json
END:VEVENT
